  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 350" role="img" aria-labelledby="bbc-title bbc-desc">
    <title id="bbc-title">Evidence-aware bulk-boundary correspondence diagram</title>
    <desc id="bbc-desc">Two gapped bulks with different invariant labels meet at an interface. A solid spectral-flow branch connects projected valence and conduction continua. A separate dashed in-gap loop represents an ordinary termination-dependent state that does not establish bulk topology.</desc>
