  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>判定：</strong>体—边对应比较的是两个体相的拓扑分类。边界谱的必需部分是连接相应体连续谱的谱流；具体能量、速度、额外闭合表面口袋和共振可随终止面变化。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Judgment:</strong> bulk–boundary correspondence compares the classifications of two bulk phases. The required part of the boundary spectrum is the spectral flow connecting the relevant bulk continua; its detailed energy, velocity, extra closed surface pockets, and resonances may depend on termination.</p>
    <p><strong>不能推出：</strong>有限 slab 中出现一条隙内线、局域在最外层，仍不足以证明拓扑保护。必须排除上下表面杂化、普通 Tamm/Shockley 态、表面共振和投影体带混合。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Not established:</strong> an in-gap line localized near the outer layer of a finite slab is still insufficient. Opposite-surface hybridization, ordinary Tamm/Shockley states, surface resonances, and projected bulk-band mixing must be separated.</p>
